    <string-array name="congklak_rules">
        <item>Take all the seeds from one hole on your side and sow them one by one, clockwise.</item>
        <item>Your store on the left gets a seed too; your opponent\'s store is skipped.</item>
        <item>Last seed lands in your store: play again.</item>
        <item>Lands in a hole with seeds: pick them all up and keep sowing.</item>
        <item>Lands in an empty hole on your side after passing your store: shoot! That seed and the seeds in the opposite hole go to your store.</item>
        <item>Haven\'t passed your store this turn? The seed stays in that hole and your turn ends.</item>
        <item>Lands in an empty hole on your opponent\'s side: your turn ends.</item>
        <item>If all your holes are empty on your turn, the game ends. Most seeds in the store wins.</item>
    </string-array>
